IndustrialCraft2-CE

This is a community port of IndustrialCraft 2, maintained by SISE-Team.
The original authors credited by the input mod are retained in the mod
metadata. Port authorship is separately recorded there and in README.md.

Migration input:
  industrialcraft-2-2.9.40+ex119-1.19.2-forge.jar
  SHA-256: 5d06ca9146041043132a72bad9b5612e260e77a84a2f3773a3da9b0167ea1d3d
  Declared license: All rights reserved

The input JAR, decompiler caches, game installations, and local runtime logs
are development inputs and are not part of the source checkout.

The org.ejml source tree contains a small compatibility implementation of
the EJML API used by the IC2 energy network. Its existing source headers
identify Apache License 2.0. A copy is included in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.
EJML project: https://github.com/lessthanoptimal/ejml

Minecraft, NeoForge, JEI, and their dependencies retain their respective
licenses. They are resolved as development dependencies and are not bundled
as game/library class files in the normal mod JAR.
